Z||000006||Alex4mula||10-16-2000||09:18 AM||||Tires look great and with a 180 treadwear should stick to the road like bubble gum. I don't know in other Fiero's but in mine they will last no more than 6K miles (rear ones). After 12 years I learned that if I want more than 18K miles in a rear tire it must have a treadwear gretaer than 300.||||reg||1
